OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos warning issued after
OL,4,Afatal bungalow blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsbestos debris has been found in the
OL,7,Farea of a fatal bungalow explosion, a
OL,8,Fcouncil has warned.
OL,10,FSteve Woodward died a few days after
OL,11,Fthe gas blast at his home on Cobb Hall
OL,12,FRoad in Newton Longville, near Milton
OL,13,FKeynes, on 9 August.
OL,15,FBuckinghamshire Council said it had
OL,16,Fbeen reassured by the UK Health
OL,17,FSecurity Agency that the risk to the
OL,18,Fcommunity was low, as any fibres
OL,19,Freleased would have been "greatly
OL,20,Fdiluted by air currents".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
