OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos warning issued after
OL,4,Afatal bungalow blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as a precaution, it has advised
OL,7,Fresidents to wash items, including any
OL,8,Fclothing that was on a washing line or
OL,9,Fgarden toys, in luke-warm water for at
OL,10,Fleast 10 minutes.
